# Build product of ref/run9b.c.
#
# Deliberately HERE and not in the root .gitignore: the root file was being
# staged by another track at the moment this landed, and a pathspec commit on a
# shared file takes the WORKING TREE, so committing it would have swept that
# track's staged hunk into a commit whose message described neither.  A
# directory-local ignore file is owned by exactly one track and cannot collide.
run9b
